   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every request goes through TanStack Query: fifteen-second stale time, one retry and only for 5xx, no refetch on focus. A\nmutation invalidates the keys it touched, so a save and a list cannot disagree.",
   "originalText": "Every request goes through TanStack Query: fifteen-second stale time, one retry and only for 5xx, no refetch on focus. A\nmutation invalidates the keys it touched, so a save and a list cannot disagree.",
