   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ids are prefixed and time-sortable, so a row says what it is and roughly when. Timestamps are stored as \"YYYY-MM-DD\nHH:MM:SS\" UTC — deliberately not ISO with a T, because a space sorts before a T and mixing the two silently reorders every\ncomparison.",
   "originalText": "Ids are prefixed and time-sortable, so a row says what it is and roughly when. Timestamps are stored as \"YYYY-MM-DD\nHH:MM:SS\" UTC — deliberately not ISO with a T, because a space sorts before a T and mixing the two silently reorders every\ncomparison.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
