   "text": "db/postgres/schema.sql calls itself \"the production system of record\" and carries CHECK (length(title) >= 4). Nothing applies\nit: boot migrates from db/migrations/pg, and CI never runs schema.sql. The title rule is really enforced at routes/index.ts:392\nand services/tasks.ts:99.",
