   "text": "routes/index.ts:945\nSELECT p.*, c.name,\n  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM tasks t\n    WHERE t.project_id = p.id) AS task_count,\n  … three more counts …\nFROM projects p JOIN clients c ON …\nmapProject(row)  snake_case → camelCase\nreply  { data: [ … ] }",
