   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A running timer past its due date must become missed. That is one UPDATE, so it runs wherever a process is awake: the\nVercel cron at 03:00, an interval every 60 s in the container, and a throttled inline sweep on the serverless path.",
   "originalText": "A running timer past its due date must become missed. That is one UPDATE, so it runs wherever a process is awake: the\nVercel cron at 03:00, an interval every 60 s in the container, and a throttled inline sweep on the serverless path.",
