   "text": "A restore drill creates a fresh database, applies a dump and reads the data back — because an untested backup is a hope, not\na backup.",
   "originalText": "A restore drill creates a fresh database, applies a dump and reads the data back — because an untested backup is a hope, not\na backup.",
